  "reviewer_note": "Weakest point: the two sources with dates are specialist/educational web pages (class other); WHE only places Lothal in Gujarat among Indus urban centres and coastal settlements. Their dates disagree (2400 vs 2200 BCE); the excavation span 1955-60 is given by both (a memoir span of 1955-62 is also quoted by StudioMatrx). Nothing here asserts the basin was a dock beyond attributing the reading to Rao.",
